        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 2 Rosenheim, Magazine Road, Cork\r\n5 Bed Terraced House | For Sale | €335,000\r\nDan Howard & Co. are delighted to present No. 2 Rosenheim to the market — a substantial five-bedroom mid-terraced residence occupying one of Cork's most sought-after and convenient locations on Magazine Road. Positioned within a few minutes' walk of University College Cork (UCC) and the Bon Secours Hospital, this property represents an outstanding opportunity in an area of consistently strong demand.\r\nLaid out over two storeys with a converted attic room, the accommodation is generously proportioned and offers excellent scope for the discerning purchaser. While the property does require some updating and modernisation, this presents a genuine opportunity to add value — and an incoming purchaser may be in a position to avail of available Government grant supports towards refurbishment and energy-efficiency upgrades.\r\nNo. 2 Rosenheim will appeal equally to the investor seeking a reliable income-producing asset and to the family with children attending college, offering the rare chance to secure a substantial home in the very heart of Cork's university and medical quarter. The property further benefits from gardens to both the front and rear. Early viewing is highly recommended. \r\n\r\nLocation\r\n\r\n A few minutes' walk to University College Cork (UCC)\r\n\r\n Within walking distance of the Bon Secours Hospital\r\n\r\n Excellent public transport links to Cork city centre\r\n\r\n Local shops, cafés and amenities close at hand\r\n\r\n Cork city centre just a short distance away\r\n\r\nDan Howard & Co. Ltd.\r\n\r\nAuctioneers, Valuers & Estate Agents\r\n\r\n46 South Mall, Cork\r\n\r\n 021 424 8654 |  087 2622382\r\n\r\n\r\nPSRA Licence No. 003581\r\nExperience Matters!!"
      },
